[![Tests](https://github.com/mohamed-ashraf-elsaed/claude-agent-sdk-laravel/actions/workflows/tests.yml/badge.svg)](https://github.com/mohamed-ashraf-elsaed/claude-agent-sdk-laravel/actions)
